WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.988
Now the code.

2
00:00:00.988 --> 00:00:05.462
This chapter adds its own module,
its own call list, an entry script,

3
00:00:05.462 --> 00:00:11.013
and the policy files themselves, one file
per object, as the workbook's design asks.

4
00:00:11.013 --> 00:00:14.954
There are the two authentication
contexts, the custom strength,

5
00:00:14.954 --> 00:00:18.599
the five administrator policies,
and the two gate policies,

6
00:00:18.599 --> 00:00:21.649
one for activation and
one for protected actions.

7
00:00:21.649 --> 00:00:26.800
The activation gate demands the strength
and a compliant device, every single time.

8
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.640
Placeholders resolve from a per-tenant map,
except the strength, which is looked up

9
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:36.190
by name in the tenant, so a policy can
never point at a strength that isn't there.
